XSS Kya Hota Hai?

Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) ek web vulnerability hai jisme attacker website ke andar apna JavaScript code run karwa sakta hai.

Normally browser website ko trust karta hai.

Agar website user input ko properly sanitize nahi karti to attacker ka JavaScript code victim ke browser me execute ho sakta hai.

Simple words me:

Attacker → Input bhejta hai
Website → Input ko page par show karti hai
Browser → Input ko code samajh kar run kar deta hai
XSS Ka Real Goal

Bahut log sochte hain:

alert(1)

hi XSS hai.

Galat.

alert(1) sirf proof of concept hai.

Real attacker kar sakta hai:

Account takeover
Admin takeover
User actions perform
Sensitive data read
Keylogging
Internal API calls
CSRF protection bypass in some cases
